WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Come into Pigeon with the right shin forward.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the left knee and hold the left foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Optional: reach the right arm up and clasp for a mermaid bind.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lift the chest and breathe.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
